Footer: Formal verification notice: 'Propagated via SGP4 analytical theory & 2D Gaussian B-Plane integral. Certified for Space Situational Awareness (SSA) flight dynamics handoff.'Automatically trigger the browser download named OrbitalGuard_CAR_<EventID>.pdf.Action: Implement the PDF generation code, trigger a test download from the CAM drawer for the critical conjunction event, and verify the formatted PDF downloads cleanly.\"\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-09-27T13:57:44+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
