A, miss distance, Pc)\n  - Section 2: Risk Assessment with regulatory threshold statement (Pc > 1.0×10⁻⁴ actionable)\n  - Section 3: CAM details if from drawer (Delta-v, propulsion type, fuel cost, post-maneuver miss distance)\n  - Footer: \"Propagated via SGP4 analytical theory & 2D Gaussian B-Plane integral. Certified for Space Situational Awareness (SSA) flight dynamics handoff.\"\n  - Auto-download as `OrbitalGuard_CAR_<EventID>.pdf`\n- Button styling: `border border-cyan-500/40 hover:bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 font-mono text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5`\n\n## 2. User Knowledge\n\n- **Goal:** Space Debris and Collision Avoidance web prototype for a hackathon. Acting as Lead Full-Stack Developer.\n- **Tech Stack:** Python (FastAPI), Vanilla HTML/JS, Tailwind CSS, CesiumJS, `satellite.js`, nipplejs.\n- **Physics Models (Strict Requirements):**\n  - Conjunction Probability of Collision (Pc) formula: Pc ≈ 1 − exp(−(R²/2σ²)exp(−d²/2σ²)) with R=10m (0.01km), σ=0.5km.\n  - Mission Risk uses Poisson distribution where Flux (F) is 5.0×10⁻⁵ (<500km), 3.5×10⁻⁴ (500-900km), 1.0×10⁻⁴ (>900km).\n- **CAM Fuel Costs:** Chemical (Hydrazine) = dv × 3.5 kg, Electric (Ion) = dv × 0.2 kg — demonstrates ISP tradeoffs.\n- **Cesium Configuration Rules:**\n  - MUST disable default providers: `imageryProvider: false` (implicit via no baseLayerPicker), `baseLayerPicker: false, geocoder: false, infoBox: false, selectionIndicator: false`.\n  - MUST inject 4K imagery manually: `UrlTemplateImageryProvider` with `url: 'https://server.arcgisonline.com/ArcGIS/rest/services/World_Imagery/MapServer/tile/{z}/{y}/{x}'`, `maximumLevel: 19`.\n  - `logarithmicDepthBuffer: true` MUST be in the Viewer constructor options to prevent clipping.\n  - Use `PathGraphics` (not static polylines) to keep satellites anchored to their orbital trail.\n  - Use `flyToBoundingSphere` with safe radius (150km) and offset (500km) for tight conjunctions — `flyTo` on close objects collapses camera distance to zero.\n  - `viewFrom = new Cesium.Cartesian3(150000.0, -150000.0, 150000.0)` for tracked entities.\n  - Pause render loop when 3D tab hidden; `viewer.resize()` when unhidden.\n- **Styling:** SpaceX-style, cinematic, dark mode, glassmorphism (`bg-black/40`, `backdrop-blur-md`). Inter font.\n- **Table layout:** Objects stacked vertically in single \"Objects Involved\" column; Date/Time stacked in single \"Approach (UTC)\" column.\n\n## 3. Work Accomplished\n\n### Backend (Python/FastAPI)\n- Fixed `sgp4()` argument mismatch bug causing 500 errors.\n- `sgp4_calc.py`: Real Pc math (2D Gaussian, returned in scientific notation), injected mock 1.2km collision for STARLINK-1007 vs COSMOS 2251 DEB.\n- `main.py`: Added `GET /api/tles`, `POST /api/mission-risk` (Poisson), `GET /api/conjunctions`.\n\n### Frontend (HTML/CSS/JS) — All Implemented\n- **Tabbed Command Center**: \"Live Tracking\", \"Risk Calculator\", \"3D Orbit Viewer\" with glassmorphism tab navigation.\n- **Live Tracking Table**: Condensed columns (Objects Involved, Approach UTC, Distance, Status). CRITICAL rows highlighted red with pulsing badges. Clicking CRITICAL opens CAM drawer; clicking non-CRITICAL switches to 3D and tracks the entity.\n- **Risk Calculator**: Slider-based inputs (altitude, area, time) → Poisson probability via backend API.\n- **3D Orbit Viewer** (CesiumJS + satellite.js):\n  - Clean engine: all default UI stripped, `logarithmicDepthBuffer: true`.\n  - 4K Esri imagery (token-free UrlTemplateImageryProvider).\n  - Real-time orbit propagation: `SampledPositionProperty` with 24-hour window (−12h to +12h, 2-min steps), Lagrange interpolation.\n  - `PathGraphics` (lead/trail 60 min each, glow material) replaced static polylines — fixes frame drift bug.\n  - SVG billboard reticles (cyan for satellites, red for debris).\n  - Smart auto-rotation with `lastInteractionTime` — pauses during interaction, resumes after 4s idle.\n  - Camera inertia tuned (0.05), zoom clamped (350km–40,000km).\n  - Click-to-lock via `ScreenSpaceEventHandler` → sets `viewFrom` + `trackedEntity`.\n  - SpaceX Floating Telemetry HUD (top-right): Name, Catalog ID, Altitude, Velocity, Risk Level with animated radar dot.\n  - Virtual joystick (nipplejs, bottom-left) bound to camera rotateRight/rotateUp in onTick.\n- **Time Machine**:\n  - Scrubber slider (−12h to +12h) controlling `viewer.clock.currentTime`.\n  - Play/Pause toggle, Speed buttons (1x/10x/60x/100x) → `viewer.clock.multiplier`.\n  - Scrubber auto-syncs during playback via onTick listener.\n  - Jump to TCA with smart fallback (auto-selects CRITICAL event if none clicked).\n  - `flyToBoundingSphere` with 150km radius + 500km offset at −35° pitch — fixes black screen on tight conjunctions.\n  - Encounter Telemetry Overlay (top-left): object names, miss distance, Pc, relative velocity, \"Resume Simulation ▶ 10x\" button.\n  - Proximity alert system: onTick checks distance between conjunction pair entities, draws glowing red `PolylineGlowMaterialProperty` laser when < 50km, shows PROXIMITY ALERT banner.\n- **CAM Planner Drawer** (right-side slide-out):\n  - TCA countdown clock (setInterval, T-MINUS HH:MM:SS).\n  - Propulsion selector (Chemical Hydrazine vs Electric Ion).\n  - Burn direction (Prograde/Retrograde toggle buttons).\n  - Delta-v slider (0–2.0 m/s) → dynamic fuel cost, Pc drop (exponential decay), miss distance simulation.\n  - Progress bar + CRITICAL/SAFE badge toggle at 50km threshold.\n  - \"Authorize Maneuver\" button → alert + drawer close.\n\n### Data Flow Wiring\n- Row clicks set: `window.setActiveTCA()`, `window.setActiveConjunctionPair()`, `window.setActiveConjunctionData()`.\n- `window._cachedConjunctions` populated on fetch for smart TCA fallback.\n\n## 4. Model Knowledge\n\n- **Uvicorn Reloading:** `uvicorn --reload` in sandbox sometimes fails to pick up changes. Safer to kill the background task and restart manually.\n- **Cesium Frame Mismatch:** Static polyline arrays baked in ECEF at init time drift from `SampledPositionProperty` as the clock advances. `PathGraphics` solves this by reading from `entity.position` every frame.\n- **TCA Camera Collapse:** When two objects are ~1.2km apart, `flyTo` or `viewer.flyTo` attempts to frame a near-zero bounding box, collapsing camera distance to zero → black screen. `flyToBoundingSphere` with an explicit `HeadingPitchRange` offset is the correct fix.\n- **Mixing flyTo + trackedEntity:** Setting `trackedEntity` immediately after `flyTo` causes the tracking system to override the flight animation's target distance. Either use `viewFrom` directly (no flyTo), or use `flyToBoundingSphere` and don't set trackedEntity.\n- **satellite.js CDN:** Already using v5.0.0 at `https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/satellite.js/5.0.0/satellite.min.js`. The user initially mentioned v4.0.0 but v5.0.0 was already imported and works.\n- **nipplejs:** Joystick move events must also update `lastInteractionTime` to prevent auto-rotation fighting the joystick input.\n\n## 5. Files and Code\n\n### Edited Files\n- **`/Users/anandgopaltiwary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/space_debris_prototype/frontend/index.html`** (~420 lines):\n  - CDN imports (Tailwind, Inter font, FontAwesome, Cesium 1.110, satellite.js 5.0.0, nipplejs 0.10.1) — lines 1-13\n  - Custom CSS (slider styling, scrollbar, animations) — lines 14-73\n  - Body with overflow-x-hidden — line 76\n  - Header + Tab nav — lines 78-101\n  - Live Tracking view with condensed table (4 columns) — lines 109-143\n  - CAM Drawer (fixed, right, w-96, z-50, overflow-y-auto) with TCA clock, propulsion selector, burn direction, slider, fuel cost, Pc, miss distance, authorize button — lines 144-225\n  - 3D Orbit Viewer (relative container) with cesiumContainer, joystick-zone, telemetry HUD, encounter overlay, time machine panel (scrubber + play/pause + speed + jump TCA + proximity alert) — lines 228-350\n  - Risk Calculator — lines 352-400+\n  - **PENDING:** Need to add jspdf CDN import and two export buttons.\n\n- **`/Users/anandgopaltiwary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/space_debris_prototype/frontend/app.js`** (~850 lines):\n  - Tab switching with Cesium lifecycle management — lines 1-57\n  - initCesium(): Viewer config, Esri imagery, camera controller, joystick init, auto-rotation — lines 62-140\n  - SampledPositionProperty propagation (24h, 2-min steps), PathGraphics, entity creation — lines 141-240\n  - Click-to-lock HUD handler + close — lines 245-270\n  - Time Machine: scrubber, play/pause, speed, formatScrubberLabel, onTick sync — lines 275-330\n  - Jump to TCA: smart fallback, precision clock jump, flyToBoundingSphere, encounter overlay, proximity laser — lines 335-460\n  - Proximity alert system (onTick distance check, CallbackProperty line) — lines 462-510\n  - fetchConjunctionData + renderTable (cached to `window._cachedConjunctions`) — lines 520-600\n  - CAM Drawer logic (TCA clock, propulsion, burn direction, Delta-v simulation, authorize) — lines 610-850\n  - **PENDING:** Need to add `generateConjunctionReport()` function and wire export buttons.\n\n- **`/Users/anandgopaltiwary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/space_debris_prototype/backend/main.py`**: GET /api/tles, GET /api/conjunctions, POST /api/mission-risk.\n- **`/Users/anandgopaltiwary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/space_debris_prototype/backend/sgp4_calc.py`**: SGP4 propagation, 2D Gaussian Pc, mock critical conjunction injection.\n\n### Running Background Tasks\n- Frontend server: `python3 -m http.server 3000` in `frontend/` dir (task-28, daemon)\n- Backend server: `uvicorn main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000` in `backend/` dir with venv activated (task-169, daemon)\n\n## 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n\n**Immediately before this checkpoint:** The user requested the PDF export feature. No code has been written for it yet. Status: NOT STARTED.\n\n**Next steps — implement in this order:**\n\n1. **Add jspdf CDN** to `index.html` `<head>` section (after nipplejs import, around line 13):\n   ```html\n   <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jspdf/2.5.1/jspdf.umd.min.js\"></script>\n   ```\n\n2. **Add Export button in header** (next to the \"Refresh Live Data\" button, around line 86 in index.html).\n\n3. **Add Export button in CAM drawer** (next to \"Authorize Maneuver\" button, around line 220 in index.html).\n\n4. **Write `generateConjunctionReport(eventData)` in app.js** using `window.jspdf.jsPDF`. The function should:\n   - Generate Document ID: `CAR-${year}-${month}-${random4digit}`\n   - Build dark professional layout with header, 3 sections, and footer per the user's exact specifications\n   - Accept event data that includes: object names, TCA, miss distance, Pc, and optionally CAM data (delta-v, propulsion type, fuel cost, post-maneuver distance)\n   - Auto-d\n---\nThe checkpoint summary has been truncated due to hitting max length. Please see the conversation log file for the full conversation."}
